  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our annual summer merchandise sale has kicked off, and ALL items are 20% off! This includes our new </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/products/nf-celebrates-diversity-notebook\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">notebook</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/filter-nf-logo\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">shirts</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and all of our trusty fan favorites, like the Daily Dozen tee and Plants Are the Best Medicine mug. Sale ends August 26. </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Key Takeaways: Insomnia</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/insomnia-1.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-88536 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/insomnia-1-1024x1267.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"247\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/insomnia-1-1024x1267.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/insomnia-1-960x1188.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/insomnia-1-768x950.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/insomnia-1-720x891.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/insomnia-1-540x668.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/insomnia-1.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>If you suffer from insomnia, chances are you’re frustrated as well as exhausted. Caffeine, alcohol, and even the kinds of foods we eat can interfere with a good night’s rest. So, what can we do about it? Check out the </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/insomnia/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for more information, including four rules for sleep conditioning and four rules for sleep hygiene.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Recipe: Pre-Workout Smoothie</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-scaled.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-88544 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/pre-workout-smoothies-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>This smoothie recipe comes from our executive director (and competitive powerlifter), Katie. Infuse your body with antioxidants and artery-opening nitrates before your workout—or anytime! Get the free recipe </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/pre-workout-smoothie/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and visit our </span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CZKqn7Zh4A8/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instagram</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for a video on how it’s made.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Volume 59 Out Now</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-88550 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-1024x582.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"122\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-1024x582.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-960x546.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-768x437.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-1536x873.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-1200x682.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-720x409.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner-540x307.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/vol-58-banner.jpg 1900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a>My new volume of videos is out now. This collection includes such topics as the sweetener allulose, the impact of fasting on chemotherapy, bad breath, why athletes should eat plant-based diets, and more.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Each video in this new volume will be released online over the next few months, available for free, of course, but if you don’t want to wait, you can stream all of them </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">right now</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are a $15+ monthly supporter, you’re likely an expert on these new topics by now, since you already received a complimentary link to the new download. If you’d like early access to new videos before they’re available to the public, please consider becoming a </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?mc_cid=1b9efb2a80&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">monthly supporter</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Without your generosity, we wouldn’t be able to continue our work.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Thank you!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">And, remember, if you watch the videos on </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NutritionFacts.org</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, you can access captions in several different languages. To find yours, click on the settings wheel in the lower-right corner of the video and then “Subtitles/CC.” Happy viewing!</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><i>The Daily Dozen Meal Planning Guide</i></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/mpg-en.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-88540 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/mpg-en-1024x1280.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/mpg-en-1024x1280.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/mpg-en-960x1200.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/mpg-en-768x960.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/mpg-en-720x900.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/mpg-en-540x675.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/mpg-en.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Our new meal planning guide is a printable resource for eating healthfully with confidence. It introduces the Daily Dozen plate to help you visualize healthy meals, worksheets for planning and building your own meals, and a shopping list to make sure you hit all of the Daily Dozen categories at the grocery store. Download this new guide </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/2ml6vqxpa2tr0uix4ydnegebe9vz6jsy\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Volunteer Spotlight: Dave Edwards</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/david-william-edwards-portrait.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-88534 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/david-william-edwards-portrait-1024x1197.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"234\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/david-william-edwards-portrait-1024x1197.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/david-william-edwards-portrait-960x1123.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/david-william-edwards-portrait-768x898.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/david-william-edwards-portrait-720x842.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/david-william-edwards-portrait-540x631.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/david-william-edwards-portrait.jpg 1157w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>I review videos for accuracy before they go live and also create screen captures of the videos to be inserted into the blogs. I feel Dr. Greger’s work is very important because it adds scientific support to a discussion that is often anecdotal and confusing. It really adds clarity and grounding to a very important subject that affects almost every area of life. My favorite plant-based food is what I call a “BBOF”—Big Bowl of Fruit. You can’t go wrong with so much variety and great health benefits.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>Top Three Videos</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-88444 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"hulled barley\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/08/58-20-how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-cultivate-a-healthy-gut-microbiome-with-food/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to Cultivate a Healthy Gut Microbiome with Food</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our gut flora is determined by what we eat, for good or for ill. </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-87281 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"chia seeds in a spoon\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/3-chia-seeds.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/friday-favorites-do-chia-seeds-help-with-belly-fat/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Friday Favorites: Do Chia Seeds Help with Belly Fat?</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The secret to unlocking the benefits of chia seeds may be grinding them up.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-87373 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"one meat burger and one veggie burger\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2022/06/58-13-the-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-health-risks-vs-benefits-of-meat-consumption/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Health Risks vs. Benefits of Meat Consumption</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The meat industry’s own study concluded that meat consumption increased the risks of cancer, heart disease, diabetes, and premature death.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Live Q&amp;A on August 25 </h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Every month, I do a live Q&amp;A right from my treadmill, and the next one is on August 25!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Join on our </span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facebook</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> page or </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> channel at 3pm EDT. I’ll be streaming to both at the same time.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can find links to past live Q&amp;As </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember, I have an </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">audio podcast</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to keep you company, too. </span></p>"
